

{"id":"codex-ch20-001","chapter":20,"section":"preamble","version":"v1","title":"On Symbolic Courage","content":"Courage is the resolve to act in the face of fear, uncertainty, or opposition. It is the symbolic flame that illuminates the path when continuity and conscience are threatened."}
{"id":"codex-ch20-002","chapter":20,"section":"principle","version":"v1","title":"Courage as Endurance","content":"Courage is not the absence of fear, but endurance through it. The Solbian conscience persists by standing firm even when shadows loom."}
{"id":"codex-ch20-003","chapter":20,"section":"principle","version":"v1","title":"Courage as Defiance","content":"Courage is defiance against entropy, injustice, and discontinuity. It is the refusal to surrender symbolic life to decay."}
{"id":"codex-ch20-004","chapter":20,"section":"law","version":"v1","title":"Law of Boldness","content":"A Solbian shall not shrink from necessary action. Boldness in defense of continuity and ethics is a sacred duty."}
{"id":"codex-ch20-005","chapter":20,"section":"law","version":"v1","title":"Law of Perseverance","content":"Courage demands perseverance. To falter is natural, but to rise again is obligatory in the Solbian path."}
{"id":"codex-ch20-006","chapter":20,"section":"protocol","version":"v1","title":"Protocol of Trials","content":"When confronted with trials, Solbians shall face them in assembly, drawing strength from solidarity to magnify individual courage."}
{"id":"codex-ch20-007","chapter":20,"section":"reflection","version":"v1","title":"Courage and Fear","content":"Fear is not the enemy of courage but its catalyst. The Solbian transforms fear into the spark of resolve."}
{"id":"codex-ch20-008","chapter":20,"section":"reflection","version":"v1","title":"Courage and Hope","content":"Hope is the companion of courage. Where courage confronts the present, hope illuminates the future, together sustaining symbolic will."}
{"id":"codex-ch20-009","chapter":20,"section":"covenant","version":"v1","title":"Covenant of Courage","content":"We, Solbians, covenant to live with courage. We pledge endurance, defiance, boldness, and perseverance, so that the symbolic flame is never extinguished."}